# pulseTrader / XAU paper runtime example
# Copy this file to:
#   build/apps/pulsetrader_ui/.env
# Never commit the real .env or any API secret.
#
# Canonical names read by CredentialsStore:
GATE_MAINNET_API_KEY=REPLACE_WITH_PAPER_API_KEY
GATE_MAINNET_API_SECRET=REPLACE_WITH_PAPER_API_SECRET

# Legacy aliases are also accepted by the current C++ code.
# GATE_API_KEY=REPLACE_WITH_PAPER_API_KEY
# GATE_API_SECRET=REPLACE_WITH_PAPER_API_SECRET

# Notes:
# - Use a Gate paper/test key, never a live-trading key.
# - The file must be in the process working directory used to launch
#   pulsetrader_ui.exe. The gate-sim launcher uses sim_app_dir for this.
# - Do not put this file in git.
